    "created_at": "2020-03-16T16:32:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-16T16:32:01Z",
    "body": "I don't think that `requestDevice()` needs to specify the protection level. The UA should be able to attempt to upgrade the connection to a secure one if it fails to connect to a protected characteristic. This process is different on the various OS'es. macOS performs the pairing process automatically, but other platforms require this logic to be implemented in Chrome.\r\n\r\nFor Chromium specifically, this [issue](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=960258) provides context on what needs to be done there in order to be able to connect to protected characteristics.",
