    "created_at": "2020-03-16T19:04:09Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-16T19:04:09Z",
    "body": "My understanding of the Bluetooth security model is that the peripheral chooses the level of protection supported, not the central. The best we can do to allow a client to enforce a particular level of pairing security is to provide an informative property on the characteristic indicating whether security was required.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
