    "created_at": "2020-03-16T19:14:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-16T19:14:48Z",
    "body": "Your understanding is wrong.\r\n\r\nRead the Bluetooth Core specification, Vol 3 Part C (GAP), section 10.3.2. The GATT client can have specific security requirements and the standard is extremely detailed how this shall be implemented.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
